Z||000002||Oreif||05-28-2001||09:45 AM||||Vacuum leaks around the EGR tube and EGR can cause the red hot exhaust too. Any large vacuum leak will cause a lean condition. If the EGR stuff is good, Start cehcking other vacuum lines and intake gaskets.||||reg||1
